    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d686">

                <pb facs="0645" n="473" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg473"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5804</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Curtis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-11T18:00:00-00:43">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 8.28 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Legation reliably informed that President of Liberia has received from British
                    Consul General a private note couched in terms calculated to force Liberia to
                    fix and publish date not later than 14th for deportation of Germans.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
